<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15498" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρρηκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unbroken, not to be broken,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμὸν . . χρύσεον ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεῖχος χάλκεον ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.56
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν᾽ ἄ. πόλις εἴη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					21.447
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. νεφέλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.150
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτολέμοιο πεῖραρ . . ἄρρηκτόν τ᾽
					ἄλυτόν τ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.360
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνή τ᾽ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.490
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πέδαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					190
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				576
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρρηκτος φυάν,</span> i.e.
				<i>invulnerable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				6(5).47
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα ἄ. ἐπὶ τοῦ
			νώτου,</span> of the crocodile, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.68
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				503a10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. χάλαζαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.16
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					25.112
				</span></i>
			; of land, <i>unploughed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tab.Heracl.
				1.19
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					182
				</span></i>
			; <i>with unbroken courage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
